repository-code: "https://github.com/pepperandhoney/beehive-peps"
abstract: >-
  Docker-based workflow for large-scale MHC-I and MHC-II peptide binding
  prediction with NetMHCpan and NetMHCIIpan. Protein identifiers are
  renumbered to survive the 15-character truncation imposed by the predictors
  and restored after parsing.